<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australia housing finance rose 5.0 pct in Jan.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australia housing finance rose 5.0 pct in Jan.</headline>
<dateline>CANBERRA 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finance commitments for owner-occupied housing in Australia rose 5.0 percent by volume to 42,408 dwellings in January from a December level of 40,393, seasonally-adjusted, the Australian Bureau of Statistics said.</p>
<p>In value terms, housing finance rose to A$4.61 billion in January from A$4.17 billion in December, the bureau said.</p>
</text>
